{
  "cards": [
    {
      "count": 8,
      "filename": "page-001.png",
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "2e88db56a3151ccdba5ba46e4011cc29006a010506819711c2737d31d1096e4a",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "[ Floor 2 deployment: Renna Holt, Mirelle Voss ] Pale deployment light closes\naround Renna Holt and Mirelle Voss at the Tower gate."
    },
    {
      "count": 8,
      "filename": "page-002.png",
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "843975a8390dcd18f6bfb29275372300c7e4d75fd956765912ffaefc64f1f1bc",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Renna keeps pressure on Mirelle's upper arm until the light takes them; then\nthey vanish from Niflheim and arrive knee-deep in cold water between\nflooded archive shelves. A bronze lantern burns ahead with a failing blue\nflame."
    },
    {
      "count": 8,
      "filename": "page-003.png",
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "0067ae2a57f8fbef3ca5ae389da7e64d86236112c1995400407d4068a1f92cd9",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Beyond it, a soaked scavenger lies pinned beneath a collapsed shelf, one\narm above the water."
    },
    {
      "count": 8,
      "filename": "page-004.png",
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "be36dba7556197f4c7766531a7db5cfb44fefce5cea8ba5fe490f677b3923940",
      "speaker": "Mirelle Voss",
      "text": "Keep your head above the water. I’m getting you out."
    },
    {
      "count": 8,
      "filename": "page-005.png",
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "de75a2dc4f6ff7ba928e4bf16854e362664d573770b353ae3f84c0a3b9d7a762",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Mirelle levers the shelf up with her spear and uninjured arm, freeing the\nscavenger. As the blue flame sputters down toward its wick, Renna lifts the\nlantern from the water and finds a soot-stiffened slider beneath its base.\nShe shields the low flame with her body."
    },
    {
      "count": 8,
      "filename": "page-006.png",
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "69712454387f407085bf249be5068c07e1ad7da1a548091670d8822d7edc6d08",
      "speaker": "Mirelle Voss",
      "text": "Bring the lantern, Renna. I’ll get them to higher stone."
    },
    {
      "count": 8,
      "filename": "page-007.png",
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "dd4be5e6980acf12d2b9fe3be3259e6f1e9f846c25aabdbd8a6f9d689f150f61",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "With the scavenger held above the floodwater, Mirelle wades after the pull\nof loose papers toward a broad aisle rising into darkness. The lantern's\nwavering blue reflection leads the same way."
    },
    {
      "count": 8,
      "filename": "page-008.png",
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "fd0f04585f967f0d37f527547d43499885e0ac55dbf8f4974aa912aedb0457af",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "System panel — Deployment confirmed: Renna Holt — 1 star; Mirelle Voss — 3 stars"
    }
  ],
